#: ../doc/main_window.rst:358
msgid ""
"If you have accidentally closed or moved a dock and can no longer find it, "
"there are a couple easy solutions. First, you can use the "
":guilabel:`View->Simple View` menu option at the top of the screen, to "
"restore the view back to its default. Or you can use the "
":guilabel:`View->Docks->...` menu to show or hide specific dock widgets on "
"the main window."
msgstr ""
"Si accidentalmente cerraste o moviste un dock y ya no puedes encontrarlo, "
"hay un par de soluciones fáciles. Primero, puedes usar la opción de menú "
":guilabel:`View->Simple View` en la parte superior de la pantalla para "
"restaurar la vista a su estado predeterminado. O puedes usar el menú "
":guilabel:`View->Docks->...` para mostrar u ocultar widgets dock específicos"
" en la ventana principal."

